  "prefLabel": "Ins 4101.03 Federal Regulations Apply",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4101.03 Federal Regulations Apply. The provisions of the US Department of Health and Human Services regulation, 45 CFR Subtitle A, Subchapter B Part 158 Issuer Use of Premium Revenue Reporting and Rebate, dated December 1, 2010, wherein referenced shall apply to all carriers subject to the provisions of Ins 4100.\n\nSource. #9690, eff 4-9-10; ss by #9938, eff 6-10-11; ss by #10212, eff 11-1-12; ss by #12799, eff 6-10-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4100.html"
